        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Rosa Martín, auteure-compositrice-interprète connue sous le nom de La Ahorcada, se suicide dans le jardin de Fran, un homme qu’elle aimait et qui la traitait comme un simple objet sexuel. Le fantôme de La Ahorcada reste dans la demeure de Fran, refusant de se laisser ignorer et déterminé à lui donner une leçon. Son obsession finira par transformer la vie de Fran et de sa famille en enfer.",
          "runtime": 91,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Rosa Martín, a singer-songwriter known as La Ahorcada, takes her own life in the garden of the man she loved, Fran, who treated her as nothing more than a sexual object. The ghost of La Ahorcada remains in Fran's mansion, refusing to be ignored and determined to teach him a lesson. Her obsession will end up turning the lives of Fran and his family into a living hell.",
          "runtime": 91,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "The Hanged Woman"
        }
      },
